/*
  UptimeMonitorWidget.strings
  TeslaSync — P4 dashboard widget · 0104 · UptimeMonitorWidget (Apple)

  The P1/S10 i18n catalog contribution for this surface. Every key the native
  `UptimeMonitorWidget` resolves (table "UptimeMonitorWidget") lives here with its
  web `t(key, default)` English value. These entries fold into the app
  `Localizable.xcstrings` master catalog at integration time; they are kept in a
  per-surface table so each parallel surface prompt owns its own strings without
  editing the shared catalog.

  The first block is the exact set of titles/labels extracted from the web source
  (features/dashboard/widgets/UptimeMonitorWidget.tsx); the remainder back the
  service labels, status words, native-only chrome (freshness chip, refresh/retry/
  empty/error copy), and accessibility.
*/

